    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahiya kūng'hangīla Yeloboamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yeloboamu walī na ng'witūnja witanagwa Abiya; ū mu shikū jenījo ūsaata ū nyanda ng'wenūyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Yeloboamu ūng'wīla ū nke wakwe, “Zwalīlaga shizwalo sha kūkwīta ūjimīlīkane; ūtizūūmanīīka gīkī ūlī nke o ng'wa Yeloboamu; ūje Shilo, alīko koi ng'hangi Ahiya, ūyo akaniwīla gīkī nakūbiza ntemi wa banhū benaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solaga migatī ikūmi ūntwaalīle, na tūkeki, na ka shisaabo ka būūkī; ūje akakūwīle īyo īkūng'wilongela ū nyanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū nke o ng'wa Yeloboamu wīta gīt'ūmo akawīlīlwa nū ngoshi, ūj'ī Shilo ū kū ng'wa Ahiya. Ī shikū jenījo ū Ahiya walī oya ū kūbona nguno ya būnamhala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū SEEBA ūng'wīla ū Ahiya, “Alīho nke o ng'wa Yeloboamu aliza kūkūbūūja mihayo ya ng'witūnja wakwe asaatile; ū bebe ūkūng'wīla gīkī na gīkī. A henaha akwiza mu kwigīmbīja gītī gīkī atī ng'wene.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Ahiya aho wajiigwa ī mhambala jakwe jikūshaadūkaga aliza a ha nyango, ūng'wīla; “Tūlīmo ū mu kaya nke o ng'wa Yeloboamu, ni kinehe ūliyīta kūbiza gītī ūtī ng'wene? Nalī na mihayo midito ya kūkūwīla nalagījiagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shokaga ū kūlī Yeloboamu ūkang'wīle gīkī ū SEEBA ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli alīhaya, ‘Ū bebe nakakūbūūcha kūfuma ū mu banhū ūbiza higūlya yabo, nūkwīta kūbiza nsugi wa banhū bane a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūbūtandūla ū būtemi nūwīnja ū kū numba ya ng'wa Daūdi, nūkwinha bebe; alīyo walemeelilwe ū kūshika ūmo walī ū ntūmami wane ū Daūdi, ūyo walī ashidimile ī shilagīlo shane, na washimīzaga mu kūnilondeela na ng'holò yakwe yose na kwīta dūhū īyo yigeleelilwe mu miso gane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū bebe wītile yabūbi no kūtinda pye abo baakūtonga ū kūbiza ho; nguno wibeegegije bamulungu bangī, ūbeeja shiikolile sha chūma sha kūsula kūlwa kūnipelanya, hūna ūninhīla ngongo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī numba ya ng'wa Yeloboamu nakwīgwisīja būbi būtaale. Ū mu numba ya ng'wa Yeloboamu nakūbamala a bagosha, pye gete abo alī nabo ū mu Isilaeli, babize balī mu wiyaabī nūūlū basese. Nakwīpemba moto ī numba ya ng'wa Yeloboamu, īpye kūshisha īshile gete pyī ī yose gītī munhū akūpembaga maashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba ng'wa Yeloboamu a ba kūchīla mu nzengo bakūliiwa mvwa, a bakūchīla kū matogolo bakūliiwa noni ja hape; h'ūmo alīhayīla ū SEEBA!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū bebe būkaga ī haha ūje kaya, gwike ū lūpambala lwako ūlū lūlakuumye dūhū ū mu nzengo, ū nyanda akūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a Baisilaeli bakūnīla na bakūnjīka; ū mu bose a ba mu kaya ya ng'wa Yeloboamu ng'wenūyo dūhū ūyo akūjīkwa, nguno ū mu numba ya ng'wa Yeloboamu hū ng'wenūyo dūhū ūyo wamanikile gīkī alī wawiza ū kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wa Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA akwipandīkīla ntemi ū mu Isilaeli; ū ng'wenūyo h'ūyo akwīkenaagūla gete pyī ī kaya ya ng'wa Yeloboamu, Nanalī nīyo? Atūdīīlaga; lyashikaga ī likanza! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū SEEBA akwītūla ī Isilaeli ībize gītī idete līkūyengeelaga mu minzī. Akwīdubbūla ī Isilaeli, yīnge ū mu sī ī yawiza yenīyī, īyo wabinha bakūlūgenji babo; hanuma akūbaponya basambaale kūshisha kūgūkīla ū Mongo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14:15",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mongo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mongo, hū kūhaya mongo gwa Flati.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nguno ū SEEBA bampelanije no kūlwa kwibeegeja ng'hīngī ja ng'wa Ashela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū akūbaponya gete a Baisilaeli kūlwa būkenaagūji bo ng'wa Yeloboamu, ūbo wahūbile, ūbingīja mu būhūbi a Baisilaeli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū nke o ng'wa Yeloboamu ūbūūka ūshoka kaya Tiliza, wapanda dūhū a ha nyango ūcha ū nyanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a Baisilaeli būnīla, hanuma būnjīka gīt'ūmo walī wahayīla ū SEEBA mu nzīla ya ntūmami wakwe ū ng'hangi Ahiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī ī ya būtemi bo ng'wa Yeloboamu yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza ī lyose īlo akatema ū Yeloboamu yalī myaka makūmi abīlī n'ībīlī, hūna ūlaala na bakūlūgenji bakwe. Ng'witūnja wakwe Nadabu wingīla a ha ng'wanya gwakwe, ūbiza ntemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lehoboamu ntemi wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Lehoboamu, ū ntemi wa Yuda walī na myaka makūmi anè na gūmò aho alandya kūtema; ūtema myaka ikūmi na mpungatī alī mu Yelusalemu, nzengo ūyo SEEBA walī wagūsolū ū mu ng'anda jose ī ja Isilaeli, gīkī atūūle ng'wenūmo ī lina lyakwe. Ū nina o ng'wa Lehoboamu ī lina lyakwe walī Naama, wa kūfuma kwihanga lya Baamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba Yuda nabo bīīta yabūbi ū mu miso ga ng'wa SEEBA; ū mu būbi wabo būng'wīta ū SEEBA kūbiza na wiilu; būmpelanya no kūtinda ūmo balī bampelanīja a bakūlūgenji babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno nabo bakibeegeja mapandī ga higūlya, na mawe ga kūlamiwa; na makīngī ga Ashela hose hose ū kwigūlya ya ngūlū, na būlī ha sīlīlī ya ntī gwa madūūtū manīlīzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu sī yabo bigela na bamalahya bagosha, ba kwiyīta kūbiza gītī bakīma; a banhū būyūyīta pyī ī yamalofu īyo yītagwa mu mahanga ayo SEEBA walī wagapeeja gabīngīle a Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū mu ng'waka gwa katanò go būtemi bo ng'wa Lehoboamu, ntemi Shishaki wa Misili ūgūdumīla ū nzengo gwa Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūjisola pyī ī sabo ījo jalī ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA nū mu numba y'ikūlū lya ntemi. Ūbūūcha būlī shikolo; ūjijaana nī mūda ja zahabu ījo walī wabeeja Solomoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi Lehoboamu ūbeeja mūda jingī ja shaba a ha ng'wanya gwajo ījo jikajanwa, ūjitūūla mu makono ga balang'hani, abo bilekelaga ndīīma ja kūlang'hana ha mita gwa kwingīlīla mu gwalugwa ya h'ikūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būl'ikanza ū ntemi ūlū alīja kū hekalu ya ng'wa SEEBA a balang'hani bajibūūchaga ī mūda jenījo; hanuma ya henaho bajishosha hangī ū mu chumba ūmo jabīkagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mihayo yīngī īyo wīta ū Lehoboamu ū mu shikū ja būtemi wakwe yandīkilwe mu shitabo sha ng'hūlū ja batemi ba Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha gatī ya ng'wa Lehoboamu nū Yeloboamu boolīho būlūgū bo shikū jose na jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Lehoboamu wifuula na bakūlūgenji bakwe, ūjīkwa hamò nabo mu nzengo go ng'wa Daūdi. Ū nina ī lina lyakwe walī Naama, wa kūfuma kwihanga lya Baamoni. Ng'witūnja wakwe Abiya wingīla a ha ng'wanya gwakwe, ūbiza ntemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.14.31"
            ]
          }
        }
